  "review": {
    "imagery": "Root reviewed all167 indexed source pages, all24 native brochure resources and18 large own-page candidates. Sixteen project community, waterfront, amenity and interior concepts selected. Generic natural textures, person-in-water stock and baked slogan imagery excluded. Canal frontage supplies the card. Concepts show the proposed wider community and require selected-home/view confirmation.",
    "floorPlans": "Root reviewed102 complete E1/E2 source sheets, whole official brochure8/11 and facts1-4, plus all80 enlarged numerical schedules. Eighty residence/retail choices,20 building plates,2 locators and2 official context sheets preserve whole drawings. Visible published values override stale hidden geometry. Fixed-component differences and StudioA1/TypeP contradictions remain explicit. Broker-hosted original plans and facts remain honestly attributed. The official28page brochure and26page mirror were both reviewed.",
    "location": "Root reviewed the whole original regional sheet. Normal GET HTML contains data-count5/7/20/25, while the unanimated00 text is a placeholder. Four current webpage estimates are adopted with explicit differences from the brochure/facts. No guessed coordinates or nature-chapter geographic coordinates assigned.",
    "provenance": "Fresh8November ordinary GET receipts retain exact URLs, retrieval dates, bytes and SHA256. Native media, whole-sheet bounds, numerical values and delivered pixels undergo independent checks before verified status. Protected ownership, IDs, aliases and completed text research remain preserved."
